<td style="text-align: left;">Logic Bug: <code>has_url</code> feature checks for <code>'http'</code>, but <code>clean_text()</code> removes all URLs <em>before</em> feature extraction. This feature will always evaluate to 0.</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Extract the <code>has_url</code> feature <em>before</em> cleaning the text.</td>
</tr>
